   "widgets_values": [
    "## OneShot MV: re-cut\n\nCuts a finished run again without re-rendering anything. Paste the run folder into **run_dir** (the Director prints it; runs live in `output/oneshot-mv/runs/`), then set:\n- **audio_fx**: `from the run`, `none`, `subtle` or `intense`;\n- **fx_intensity**: 0 for no FX, 1 for the normal strength, up to 3 for heavier;\n- **finish**: the grade, grain and vignette.\n\nThe new cut replaces `final_<format>.mp4` in the run folder. The Studio's Post Processing does the same with FX per energy section and a grade preview."
   ],
   "title": "How it works"
  },
